stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> OPEN: step failed for good (job FAILED, business error, refused answer)
  OPEN --> OPEN: retry (processes:incident:manage), job DUE again or handler run again
  OPEN --> OPEN: retried step fails again, new cause
  OPEN --> RESOLVED: retried step accepted, RETRY_SUCCEEDED
  OPEN --> RESOLUTION_PENDING: resolve with output and reason (four-eyes)
  RESOLUTION_PENDING --> OPEN: reject-resolution by a second person
  RESOLUTION_PENDING --> RESOLVED: approve-resolution by a second person, COMPLETED_MANUALLY
  OPEN --> RESOLVED: resolve with single (dev profile only)
  OPEN --> RESOLVED: instance cancelled, INSTANCE_CANCELLED
  RESOLUTION_PENDING --> RESOLVED: instance cancelled, INSTANCE_CANCELLED
  RESOLVED --> [*]
  classDef client fill:#E3F2FD,stroke:#1565C0,color:#16231F
  classDef engine fill:#E0F2F1,stroke:#00796B,stroke-width:2px,color:#16231F
  classDef obs fill:#ECEFF1,stroke:#546E7A,color:#16231F
  class OPEN client
  class RESOLUTION_PENDING engine
  class RESOLVED obs
